{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection", "label": "S6 \u2014 collection (stage doc, referenced)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-08-15", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection", "label": "S6 \u2014 Collection and Word Detail (research doc)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md"}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection_d55", "label": "D55 \u2014 searchParamsToBag moves into items-query.ts as an exported function", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md", "rationale": "It existed once inside a test file the app cannot import; moving it means the round-trip suite covers the exact function the route runs."}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection_d56", "label": "D56 \u2014 facets returned in the same response as items, not a second call", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md", "rationale": "Measured zero facet rows in owner_item_facets; fetching an empty array in a second round trip is not worth a call."}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection_d57", "label": "D57 \u2014 no pagination on the collection list", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md", "rationale": "Measured payload ~32KB for 70 rows; the trigger to revisit is a measurement (~100KB or a visible pause), not a feeling."}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection_d58", "label": "D58 \u2014 one Host + SwiftUI List for the collection, not a Host per row", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md", "rationale": "70 rows \u2248 32KB kills the virtualization objection, and List carries selection/onSelectionChange natively."}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection_d60", "label": "D60 \u2014 search stays client-side / in-memory, not part of ItemsQuery", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md"}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection_d61", "label": "D61 \u2014 serializeItemsQuery stays the only encoder", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md", "rationale": "Writing a second encoder (JSON body, hand-built query string) is the one thing this stage could do that would be expensive to undo."}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection_d62", "label": "D62 \u2014 S6's writes are direct routes, not the sync outbox", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md", "rationale": "lesson-items is online-only by design on both clients; MirrorItem is keyed on a lesson_id a standalone word doesn't have."}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection_d63", "label": "D63 \u2014 create-lesson-from-selection reuses buildCreateLessonOp + postOp", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md"}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection_d64", "label": "D64 \u2014 word detail is a plain RN screen", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md", "rationale": "It is typography, not controls."}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection_d65", "label": "D65 \u2014 collection reached by a header button; tab bar deferred to S7", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md"}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection_d66", "label": "D66 \u2014 favorite is keyed on norm_key, not item id", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md"}, {"id": "docs_2026_08_13_expo_s6_collection_d67", "label": "D67 \u2014 category filter renders but must not be designed for", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-13-expo-s6-collection.md", "rationale": "Zero facet rows measured; the gate cannot test the category filter."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_2026_08_13_